nd profile.\n\nNo public polls of the race are available, so the picture rests on the district's lean, Mast's incumbency, and the unanimous judgment of race analysts across the spectrum, who place the contest in Solid or Safe Republican territory. Prediction markets give Martin roughly a one-in-ten chance. The main source of uncertainty is the national midterm climate, which could shift margins but would need to be unusually strong to threaten Mast.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.066, "margin": -9.63}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.058, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0551, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0462, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.033, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0554, "margin": -10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0411, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.0389, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0644, "margin": -10.5}]}